{"id":"accidentalmente","lemma":"accidentalmente","pos":"adv","rank":3779,"glosses":["accidentally"],"ipa":"/aɡθiˌdentalˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-accidentalmente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Accidentalmente vertí la leche.","en":"I accidentally spilled the milk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804186","words":[null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"amazing, very good"]]},{"text":"El arma se disparó accidentalmente.","en":"The gun went off by accident.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"weapon, arm"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"},null]},{"text":"Accidentalmente me encontré con ella en la estación.","en":"I met her at the station by accident.","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"station"}]},{"text":"Tom borró accidentalmente todos sus mensajes.","en":"Tom accidentally deleted all his messages.","words":[null,{"g":"to erase, to delete","l":"borrar"},null,{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"message","l":"mensaje"}]},{"text":"Él accidentalmente se golpeó en el pulgar con el martillo.","en":"He accidentally hit his thumb with the hammer.","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to hit","l":"golpear"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"thumb, big toe"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hammer"}]}]}